Subject: [PATCH 15/19] tests: Expect a zoom percentage in the arrangement view

wdisplays shows its zoom as a percentage. The view has zoom steps and Fit All and shows no
number. A label in the view should say how large the screens are drawn, as a percentage of
their real size in pixels, and follow Zoom In, the wheel and Fit All.

Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5
---
 tests/arrangementview.cpp | 43 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 43 insertions(+)

diff --git a/tests/arrangementview.cpp b/tests/arrangementview.cpp
index 8ed5dced..30649b3c 100644
--- a/tests/arrangementview.cpp
+++ b/tests/arrangementview.cpp
